 song -- Lady in the dark. My ship -- Happy end. Song of the big shot -- Marie Galante. J'atends un navire -- Je ne t'aime pas -- Street scene. Remember that I care8 aDisc 2. One touch of Venus. I'm a stranger here myself -- Happy end. Surabaya-Johnny -- The firebrand of Florence. Sing me not a ballad -- Nannas Lied -- Street scene. Lonely house -- Marie Galante. Le train du ciel --The threepenny opera. Solomon song -- Youkali : Tango habanera -- Epitaph -- One touch of Venus. That's him -- Knickerbocker holiday. It never was you  aRecorded February, 1991, at Master Sound Astoria Studios, Astoria, NY. 0aRequiemsvExcerpts, Arranged. 0aMusicalsvExcerpts, Arranged.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008107514 0aOperasvExcerpts, Arranged.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85094936 0aSongs (High voice) with piano.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85125149 6aRequiem0(CaQQLa)201-0077894vExtraits arr.0(CaQQLa)201-0377162 6aOpérasvExtraits arr.0(CaQQLa)201-0014138 6aChansons (Voix aiguë) acc. de piano.0(CaQQLa)201-0056378 7aMusicalsxExcerpts, Arranged.2fast0(OCoLC)fst014260460http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1426046 7aOperasxExcerpts, Arranged.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010462070http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1046207 7aSongs (High voice) with piano.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011261530http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1126153 7aSound recordings.2aat0(CStmoGRI)aatgf300028633 7aExcerpts.2aat0(CStmoGRI)aatgf300026939 7aSound recordings.2fast0(OCoLC)fst014116390http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1411639 7aExcerpts.2fast0(OCoLC)fst016928370http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1692837 7aArrangements (Music)2fast0(OCoLC)fst019204350http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1920435 7aSound recordings.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026594 7aExcerpts.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026097 7aArrangements (Music)2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027203 7aEnregistrements sonores.2rv