grounds and places. From an investigation into the lithium mines in the Democratic Republic of Congo to maps of the fiber-optic submarine cables in the Atlantic and the ride-hailing platforms of China. Vertical Atlas is not a classic atlas that depicts the world in a uniform manner and it is not a collection of traditional maps. It is a set of tools that enable comparisons, connections, and the seeing of connections and contradictions between different and diverse visions, realities and techno-political worlds - through newly commissioned diagrams, interviews, essays and works of art by leading experts from around the world."--cprovided by distributor  aStandard Copyright10aArtificial intelligence.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8500818010aBiopolitics.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8501425410aCartography.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8502051510aCity planning.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8502628210aCloud computing.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh200800488310aGeopolitics.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8505419210aGlobalization.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh9901017910aNatural resources.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8509025410aTransborder data flow.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8600763517aArtificial intelligence.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008172470http://id.worldcat.org/fast/81724717aBiopolitics.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008326680http://id.worldcat.org/fast/83266817aCartography.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008480250http://id.worldcat.org/fast/84802517aCloud computing.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017458990http://id.worldcat.org/fast/174589917aGeopolitics.2fast0(OCoLC)fst009410450http://id.worldcat.org/fast/94104517aGlobalization.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017362290http://id.worldcat.org/fast/94353217aNatural resources.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010344030http://id.worldcat.org/fast/103440317aTransborder Data Flows.2fast0(OCoLC)fst0115451917aUrbanism.2fast0(OCoLC)fst00