l ; How blest are shepherds -- Celemene -- Six duets (1961). Sound the trumpet ; I spy Celia ; Lost is my quiet ; What can we poor females do? ; No, resistance is but vain ; Shepherd, leave decoying0 aFrom Harmonia sacra: The queen's epicedium -- The blessed Virgin's expostulation -- Saul and the Witch at Endor -- Three divine hymns (1947). Lord, what is man? ; We sing to him ; Evening hymn -- Job's curse -- Two divine hymns and alleluia (1950). A morning hymn ; Alleluia ; In the black dismal dungeon of despair -- Dulcibella -- When Myra sings -- Let the dreadful engines of eternal will0 aHard copy version record 0aSacred songs.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85116317 0aIncidental music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85088853 0aSongs with piano.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85125211 0aSacred vocal music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85116385 0aDramatic music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh87002062 6aChants sacrés.0(CaQQLa)201-0068586 6aMusique de scène.0(CaQQLa)201-0004403 6aChansons acc. de piano.0(CaQQLa)201-0030516 6aMusique vocale sacrée.0(CaQQLa)201-00047481 aBritten, Benjamin,d1913-1976,earranger of music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n791057911https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJv8FjVyGtymD7gHYpctrq1 aLott, Felicity,esinger.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n821062081https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJr7T7wJCmMdGbBPP6jV4q1 aGritton, Susan,esinger.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n940333861https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJyWY4wpbwMcRfGyfKqJDq1 aWalker, Sarah,d1943-esinger.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n790119921https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJfWVjgBc8PpxVfGrdVBfq1 aBowman, James,esinger.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n821456081https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJg4hwVH8tdPgw9Fwh78md1 aAinsley, John Mark,esinger.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no890210111https://id.oclc.or