d.tPurcell realizations.dLondon : Hyperion, [2006]w(OCoLC)7120602640zAvailable to Stanford-affiliated users.uhttp://stanford.naxosmusiclibrary.com/catalogue/item.asp?cid=00602458154450yNaxos Music LibraryxProvider: NaxosxCollection: Naxos Music LibraryxsubscribedxeLoaderURLxnm4xnmon1460994421  aeLoaderRecord xnm4ffi4e8535be-3cb7-4a23-a6f8-c4274c599a5as1c1fac5a-0698-4c45-96d6-6f3dfad8e3ad08183cjm a2201009 i in0000025777520250403135150.0sd fsngnnmmned181005p19941938cauopnn  f        n ita d  a  2018628533  a42572337a580310511 a7243565431268 a243565431202aCDM 5 65431 2 6bEMI Classics  a(OCoLC)ocm31620675   a(OCoLC)31620675z(OCoLC)42572337z(OCoLC)58031051  aSVPbengcDLCdWAUdW7LdEYMdFCMdOCLCFdUMCdGILDSdSVPdOCLCAdCSOdOCLCOdOCLCAdOCLCOdOCLCLdSTFdUtOrBLW0 ditadfredgergeng  alccopycat  aSTFA00aTenors in the grand tradition 1aHollywood, Calif. :bEMI Classics,c[1994] 4c℗1994  a1 audio disc (69 min., 15 sec.) :bdigital, stereo, mono ;c4 3/4 in.  aperformed musicbprm2rdacontent  aaudiobs2rdamedia  aaudio discbsd2rdacarrier  adigitalbopticalgstereo2rda  aaudio filebCD audio2rda  aArias in Italian, French or German  aTitle from disc label  oRecordedd1938-1968  aProgram notes in English on insert  aPreviously released material0 aThe pearl fishers. Je crois entendre encore / Bizet (Nicolai Gedda) -- Romeo et Juliette. Ah! lève-toi, soleil / Gounod (Jussi Björling) -- Le Roi d'Ys. Puisqu'on ne peut fléchir / Lalo (Beniamino Gigli) -- Don Giovanni. Dalla sua pace / Mozart (Luigi Alva) -- Turandot. Non piangere, Liu / Puccini (Giuseppe di Stefano) -- L'elisir d'amore. Una furtiva lagrima / Donizetti (Ferruccio Tagliavini) -- Aida. Se quel guerriero io fossi! / Verdi (Richard Tucker) -- Mignon. Addio, Mignon / Thomas (Giuseppe di Stefano) -- Manon Lescaut. Donna non vidi mai / Puccini (Franco Corelli) -- L'Arlesiana. E la solita storia del pastor / Cilea (Beniamino Gigli) -- La Fanciulla del West. Ch'ella mi creda libero / Puccini (Giuseppe di Stefano) -- Das Land des Lächelns. Dein ist mein ganzes Herz / Lehár (Fritz Wunderlich) -- Tosca. Dammi i colori / Puccini (Carlo Bergonzi) -- Il Barbiere di Siviglia. Ecco, ridente in cielo / Rossini (Luigi Alva) -- Fedora. Amor ti vieta / Giordano (Beniamino Gigli) -- La Bohème. Che gelida manina / Puccini (Jussi Björling) -- L'Amico Fritz. O amore, o bella luce del core / Mascagni (Luciano Pavarotti) -- Andrea Chenier. Come un bel dì di Maggio / Giordano (Franco Corelli) -- Tosca. E lucevan le stelle / Puccini (Carlo Bergonzi) -- Le belle Hélène. Au mont Ida trois déesses / Offenbach (Jussi Björling)0 aVarious tenors singing opera arias, in Italian, French and German, accompanied by various orchestras  aOpera arias in Italian, French or German 0aOperasvExcerpts.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85094931 0aSolo cantatas.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85124681 0aSongs.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85125040 6aOpérasvExtraits.0(CaQQLa)201-0014136 6aCantates pour soliste.0(CaQQLa)201-0004735 6aChansons.0(CaQQLa)201-0004736 7aOperasxExcerpts.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010462030http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1046203 7aSolo cantatas.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011255770http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1125577 7aSongs.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011261200http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1126120 7aExcerpts.2aat0(CStmoGRI)aatgf300026939 7aExcerpts.2fast0(OCoLC)fst016928370http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1692837 7aExcerpts.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026097 7aExtraits.2rvmgf0(CaQQLa)RVMGF-0000010401 aGedda, Nicolai.4sng0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n810425941 aBjörling, Jussi,d1911-1960.4sng0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n500196141https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJh4tCKxBbQ3P8PGcPV6Kd1 aGigli, Beniamino,d1890-1957.4sng0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n820327181https://id.oclc.org/worldca